            <ArticleTitle>Diagnosis of patellofemoral pain syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1427</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This syndrome, also known as chondromalacia patellae, is characterised by pain and crepitus around the patella during activities that require flexion of the knee under loading, for example, climbing stairs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
